  "solution": "Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math> (m) là chiều rộng của mảnh vườn thì chiều dài mảnh vườn là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (m).<br>Điều kiện <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>60</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math><br>Diện tích mảnh vườn là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>60</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Diện tích mảnh vườn cần có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>60</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>⇔</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math> hoặc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Bảng xét dấu\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/f126b5d604d3816da946bbd066cea9009c0190cc1762a351fd1806a3d72663ab.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tNhư vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên chiều rộng nhỏ nhất của mảnh vườn là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>10</mn></semantics></math> m.",
